<h2>Stara Lesna</h2>
<p>A view on the High Tatras from a meadow near the <a href="https://www.astro.sk/en/home/">Astronomical Insitute</a> of Slovak Acadamy of Sciences, Northern Slovakia.</p>
<p>This 4096x2048 panorama was stitched from photos taken on September 20, 2022. Southern horizon is a bit lower, since it was taken on a hill.</p>
